The model lineage derives from ICPR_2026_LRP_REG by Huấn Trần (Kaggle:
huantranvan, https://www.kaggle.com/code/huantranvan/icpr-2026-lrp-reg), itself
listed as copied from https://www.kaggle.com/code/trungnguyen0510/icpr-2026-lrp-reg.

app/recognition/icpr_model.py retains the notebook's inference architecture
with original module names for strict state_dict loading; the training-only
super-resolution branch, dataset indexing, training, optimization and notebook
side effects are not included.

app/recognition/icpr_adapter.py and ctc_decoders.py implement the notebook's
preprocessing, optional TTA averaging and greedy/beam CTC decoders.
app/recognition/video_tracking.py ports the notebook's adaptive sampling,
empty-scene gate, BoT-SORT clock, quality-based five-crop selection and crop
export. Tests use synthetic weights unless stated otherwise.

